WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.400
One rule decided every part of this page.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.600
Put the answer next to the doubt.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.800
Two shoppers.
Two doubts that stop the sale.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.400
Will this shade match me?
Will this size fit me?

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.000
This page answers both,
before it asks you to buy.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.800
Shade mismatch is the top reason
complexion products come back.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.000
Get it wrong once,
and people stop buying it online.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.300
On mobile, where most of them shop,
only 38% of product pages are even decent.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.900
Here is the whole product page,
top to bottom.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:33.000
Discover. Evaluate. Select. Purchase.
One rule at every step.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.200
The photo
Find my shade sits on the photo, where the doubt starts.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.300
Other pages:
Try on hides as an unlabelled thumbnail.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.400
Price and offer
Buy at ₹375 with NEW15. Worked out next to the price.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.200
Other pages:
A row of coupon codes. The maths is yours.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.800
Shade
Named shades, light to deep. Then the one fact
that matters: shades cannot be returned.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.900
Other pages:
“290”. “Shade 128”. Add to Bag sits above the shade row.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:56.100
Getting it to you
Pincode, delivery date and cash on delivery, before you commit.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.600
Reviews
“Did 230 match?” 64% matched. Filtered to shades near yours.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.700
Other pages:
One star average for every shade.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:06.000
Goes with your shade
Pairings picked for the shade you chose, not the bestseller list.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.500
Not sure of your shade?
Ask, right on the page.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:14.000
Two questions.
Three matches with real match rates.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Pick one and the whole page switches to it.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:24.000
The doubt changes. Will it fit?

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:27.200
The photo
Size help on the photo. Model wears M, 5’7”.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:29.000
Other pages:
Fit data on the app only. Two words on web.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.600
Size
One honest sentence above the sizes: Sangria’s M runs a size small.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.200
Other pages:
Pick a size with nothing to go on.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.900
Returns
Free 7 day returns and one free exchange, said before you buy.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:43.000
Reviews
“Did size M fit?” 64% true to size, from people near your size.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:53.800
The same page, in two columns.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:59.500
Bad news, said once, with a way out.

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.500
Beauty and fashion product page

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:07.900
One rule, on every section:
put the answer next to the doubt.
